            <REF_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a522" ANNOTATION_REF="a521">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>We use SLEXIL to render ELAN XML output as interactive web pages. Pronounced "sluck-HAIL", SLEXIL means daylight in the Lushootseed language, for which it was originally developed. The name may also be understood as an acronym: Software Linking ELAN XML to Illuminated Language.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
